# Explicitly declared columns over RealEstateData (headers default to the field names); ID is the generated key 1001 + row index.
Then this grid will have the header cells with the following text: ID, Property, Rooms, Baths, Built, Price
Then this grid will have data cells with these values in the visible rows:
  | ID        |
  | 1001      |
  | 1002      |
  | 1003      |
  | 1004      |
